      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "必殺の剣と名高いキルソードを所望している。\nなんでもレギアの町で手に入ると聞くが……\nそれを納めてはもらえないだろうか？\n負けられぬ戦いを控えている。是非に頼む。",
        "official_en": "I seek a renowned blade known as a killing edge.\nIf your adventures take you to Regia, would you be\nwilling to get one of these blades for me? With it,\nI may just prevail in the battle that awaits me.",
        "real_en": "I seek a renowned blade known as a Kill Sword.\nIf your adventures take you to Legia, would you be\nwilling to get one of these blades for me? With it,\nI may just prevail in the battle that awaits me."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "UNREVIEWED"
      }
    },
