      },
      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "キルソードの手配、かたじけない。\nこの刀身の見事さ、目を見張るものがあるな！\nだが、どうやら対戦相手もこれを入手したとか。\n結局は己が腕次第……ふ、それもまた一興！",
        "official_en": "You've brought me a killing edge! Magnificent.\nBut it seems my opponent has also obtained the\nsame. It will be skill that decides this outcome, then.\nWell, I suppose that's all part of the fun!",
        "real_en": "You've brought me a Kill Sword! Magnificent.\nBut it seems my opponent has also obtained the\nsame. It will be skill that decides this outcome, then.\nWell, I suppose that's all part of the fun!"
      },
